    "Detekt tagged implementation checks resolved suspend descriptors; analyzer/compiler versions and environments differ. Exact erroneous binding-context/metadata path was not instrumented, so a particular decoder/friend-path bug is not asserted.",
    "No production, game rule, protocol 4.2, persistence format, private projection or resource changes belong to this follow-up."
